### 3. GH-Issues Auto-Fix

#### [NEW] [ghIssuesService.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/GitHub/usa-app/backend/ghIssuesService.js)

Adaptare simplificată a flow-ului OpenClaw `gh-issues` (6 faze → 4 faze).

| Funcție | Ce face |
|---|---|
| `autoFixIssue(owner, repo, issueNumber)` | Fix complet: analyze → branch → fix → commit → push → PR |
| `analyzeIssue(owner, repo, issueNumber)` | Evaluează dacă issue-ul e rezolvabil (confidence 1-10) |
| `batchFixIssues(owner, repo, options)` | Fetch issues → fix multiple secvențial |
| `getFixStatus(taskId)` | Status fix în progres |

**Flow `autoFixIssue()`:**
```
Phase 1: Fetch issue details (githubService)
Phase 2: Confidence check — Gemini evaluează dacă poate rezolva
Phase 3: Fix — codingAgentService.executeTask()
Phase 4: Git operations — branch, commit, push, create PR (via processManager + githubService)
```

