### 5. Server Routes

#### [MODIFY] [server.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/GitHub/usa-app/backend/server.js)

**Process Manager routes:**
- `GET /api/processes` — listează procese
- `GET /api/processes/:id` — status + log
- `POST /api/processes/:id/input` — send input
- `DELETE /api/processes/:id` — kill

**Coding Agent routes:**
- `POST /api/coding/task` — lansează task de cod
- `POST /api/coding/review` — review PR
- `GET /api/coding/task/:id` — status task

**GH-Issues routes:**
- `POST /api/github/auto-fix/:owner/:repo/:number` — auto-fix un issue
- `POST /api/github/analyze-issue/:owner/:repo/:number` — confidence check
- `POST /api/github/batch-fix/:owner/:repo` — batch fix

